# Implementation Plan: Multi-Terminal Manager & Global Workspace Search/Replace

Build two core capabilities for Cortex:
1. **Multi-Terminal Manager & Shell Switcher**: Multi-session terminal tabs, live shell selector (PowerShell, Command Prompt, Git Bash, WSL), persistent background process sessions, and tab management.
2. **Global Workspace Search & Replace (`Ctrl+Shift+F`)**: Full-text & regex file searching across the workspace via backend IPC, interactive results panel in the Sidebar grouped by file, line/column jumping in Monaco, and batch workspace replace.

